#   computed_values_3 - ComputedValues: construction and the first accessors
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/ComputedValues.h (lines 504-640): the ComputedValues default constructor
#       (and `css_computed_values_create`, the port's `make<ComputedValues>()`), visit_edges and the
#       read accessors up to `block_axis_is_reverse`. Each accessor answers a field of the inherited
#       or non-inherited values, as the C++ inline members do.
